  "notes": "{辞任|じにん} is used for formal resignations from official positions.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {辞任|じにん}する: to resign\n- {辞任|じにん}を{表明|ひょうめい}する: to announce one's resignation\n- {辞任|じにん}を{求|もと}める: to call for (someone's) resignation\n- {辞任|じにん}{届|とどけ}: letter of resignation\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {退職|たいしょく}: retirement, leaving a job\n- {辞職|じしょく}: resignation (similar, often interchangeable)\n- {引退|いんたい}: retirement (from career/sports)",
